      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "For a more elaborate example, refer: https://scikit-learn.org/stable/auto_examples/applications/plot_out_of_core_classification.html#sphx-glr-auto-examples-applications-plot-out-of-core-classification-py"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "X923v4Dz1rS5"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# TF idf\n",
        "\n",
        "Term Frequency: TF of a term or word is the number of times the term appears in a document compared to the total number of words in the document.\n",
        "\n",
        "TF = $\\dfrac{\\verb|  number of times the term appears in the document|}{\\verb|Total number of terms in the document|}$\n",
        "\n",
        "Inverse Document Frequency: IDF of a term reflects the proportion of documents in the corpus that contain the term. Words unique to a small percentage of documents (e.g., technical jargon terms) receive higher importance values than words common across all documents (e.g., a, the, and).\n",
        "\n",
        "IDF = $\\log (\\dfrac{\\verb|Numbers of documents in the corpus + 1|}{\\verb|Numbers of documents in the corpus contain the term + 1|})$\n",
        "\n",
        "adding 1 in numerator is a choice. you can skip that also.\n",
        "\n",
        "The TF-IDF of a term is calculated by multiplying TF and IDF scores.\n",
        "\n",
        "TF-IDF = TF * IDF\n",
        "\n",
        "- Example\n",
        "\n",
        "||corpus|\n",
        "|---|---|\n",
        "|r1|“this is a a sample”|\n",
        "|r2|“this is another another example example example”|\n",
        "\n",
        "## Calculate TF-IDF for the word \"this\"\n",
        "  - TF(\"this\" in r1) = $\\dfrac{1}{5} = 0.2$\n",
        "  - TF(\"this\" in r2) = $\\dfrac{1}{7} = 0.14$\n",
        "  - IDF(this) =   $\\log(3/3) = 0$\n",
        "\n",
        "- Tfidf =0.2 * 0 = 0\n",
        "- Tfidf = 0.14 * 0 = 0\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## Calculate TF-IDF for the word \"example\"\n",
        "  - TF(\"example\" in r1) = $\\dfrac{0}{5} = 0$\n",
        "  - TF(\"example\" in r2) = $\\dfrac{3}{7} = 0.429$\n",
        "  - IDF(example) =   $\\log(3/2) = 0.176$\n",
        "\n",
        "- Tfidf =0 * 0.176 = 0\n",
        "- Tfidf = 0.429 * 0.176 = 0.0755\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## Try to calculate TF & IDF for \"sample\"\n",
        "- TFidf (\"sample\" in r1) = 0.0352\n",
        "- TFidf(\"sample\" in r1) = 0"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "HhA1dULx95Dx"
      }
